#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"I<OBJECT> := { B<address> | B<addrlabel> | B<fou> | B<help> | B<ila> | "
"B<ioam> | B<l2tp> | B<link> | B<macsec> | B<maddress> | B<monitor> | "
